  m_previewPrefab: {fileID: 7821697728655158839, guid: de0f0460a5b8442098ed6e41118a58b3, type: 3}
  m_descriptionText: Left right next to you. Someone wanted you to read it.
  m_readableText: "If you're reading this, they dumped you here too.\n\nThey throw
    out anything that runs on batteries now. Get up and move.\n\nMOVING\n  Modern:
    W A S D moves you the way the view is looking.\n  Tank: Up / Down walks forward
    and back, Left / Right turns in place.\n  Hold Shift to run. Running wears you
    out.\n\nE to take things. Tab to check what you carry.\n\nStay quiet. They hunt
    anything that moves."
